{"id":"en_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love","title":"The CEO Reclaims Her Empire and Love","titleEn":"The CEO Reclaims Her Empire and Love","description":"Wu Shuyao was once a powerful figure in the business world, but her life is upended when she is accused of embezzlement. The betrayal comes from two people she trusted most: her romantic partner, Xu Jiahao, and her closest friend. Together they orchestrate the scheme that brings about her downfall. Stripped of her position and reputation, Wu Shuyao must find a way to clear her name and rebuild what was taken from her. The story follows her determined efforts to reclaim both her business empire and her sense of self after being deceived by those closest to her. Those interested in following this tale of betrayal and comeback can watch it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love/cover.jpg","backdrop":"https://pub-fd04cb02d0724cbe8719ff59aba68757.r2.dev/series/nt_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love/cover.jpg","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["دراما قصيرة","الحضر","من الصفر إلى بطل","الانتقام","توتر رومانسي","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dttzm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dttzm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dttzm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ceo-reclaims-her-empire-and-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"ht